<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Topracon Yönetim</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 22 22'%3E%3Crect width='22' height='5' fill='%23D8C69A'/%3E%3Crect y='5' width='22' height='6' fill='%23A66F4F'/%3E%3Crect y='11' width='22' height='5' fill='%237A4F38'/%3E%3Crect y='16' width='22' height='6' fill='%2326342B'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#26342B">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --soil:#26342B; --field:#607A55; --clay:#A66F4F; --wheat:#D8C69A;
  --paper:#F4F1E8; --paper2:#FBF9F3; --signal:#D6A928; --alert:#8E4A32; --ink:#1C2620;
  --line:rgba(28,38,32,.16); --line2:rgba(28,38,32,.08);
  --disp:"Manrope","Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif;
  --mono:"IBM Plex Mono",ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--disp);font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.5;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
h1,h2,h3,h4{margin:0;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.15}
h1{font-size:1.45rem}h2{font-size:1.16rem}h3{font-size:1rem}
p{margin:0}
button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;color:inherit}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:2.5px solid var(--field);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:4px}
.mono,.num{font-family:var(--mono);font-feature-settings:"tnum" 1}
.dim{color:rgba(28,38,32,.45)}
.tiny{font-size:.82rem;color:rgba(28,38,32,.58);line-height:1.45}
pre{margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap}

/* giriş */
.login-wrap{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#1B241E;padding:20px}
.login{width:100%;max-width:400px;background:var(--paper);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
.login .lh{background:var(--soil);color:var(--paper);padding:24px}
.login .lh h1{margin-top:16px;color:#FBF9F3;font-size:1.32rem}
.login .lh p{margin-top:7px;font-size:.9rem;color:rgba(216,198,154,.82)}
.login .lb{padding:22px 24px 26px}
.mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-weight:800;font-size:1.06rem;letter-spacing:-.035em}
.logo{display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:18px;flex:none}
.logo i{display:block;height:4.5px}

label.f{display:block;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px 12px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;
  background:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:.94rem;color:var(--ink)}
textarea{min-height:80px;resize:vertical;line-height:1.5}
.field+.field{margin-top:13px}
.f2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:13px}
@media(max-width:560px){.f2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:42px;
  padding:0 18px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--field);color:#FBF9F3;font-weight:700;font-size:.93rem}
.btn:hover{background:#4E6746}
.btn.soil{background:var(--soil);color:var(--paper)}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1.5px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
.btn.ghost:hover{background:rgba(28,38,32,.05)}
.btn.wheat{background:var(--signal);color:var(--soil)}
.btn.block{width:100%}
.btn.sm{min-height:34px;padding:0 13px;font-size:.86rem;border-radius:6px}
.btn[disabled]{opacity:.45;cursor:default}
.msg{display:none;margin-top:14px;padding:11px 13px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:500}
.msg.on{display:block}
.msg.bad{background:rgba(142,74,50,.12);color:var(--alert)}
.msg.info{background:rgba(214,169,40,.16);color:#7A5F10}

/* kabuk */
#app{display:none}
.shell{display:flex;min-height:100vh}
.side{width:224px;flex:none;background:var(--soil);color:var(--paper);position:sticky;top:0;
  height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:16px 12px}
.side>.mark{padding:0 8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,241,232,.16);margin-bottom:10px}
.nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;flex:1;overflow-y:auto}
.nav button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:7px;
  font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;color:rgba(216,198,154,.82);text-align:left;width:100%}
.nav button:hover{background:rgba(244,241,232,.09);color:#FBF9F3}
.nav button[aria-current="true"]{background:var(--signal);color:var(--soil)}
.nav .bdg{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;background:var(--alert);
  color:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:1px 6px;font-weight:600}
.nav button[aria-current="true"] .bdg{background:var(--soil);color:var(--signal)}
.nav .grp{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;
  color:rgba(216,198,154,.45);padding:14px 10px 5px;font-weight:600}
.side .me{border-top:1px solid rgba(244,241,232,.16);padding-top:12px;margin-top:8px;
  font-size:.82rem;color:rgba(216,198,154,.75);line-height:1.35}
.side .me b{display:block;color:#FBF9F3;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem}
.side .me button{margin-top:9px;border:1px solid rgba(244,241,232,.3);border-radius:6px;
  padding:6px 10px;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;width:100%}
.side .me button:hover{background:rgba(244,241,232,.12)}
.main{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:22px 24px 60px}
.head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:18px}
.head p{color:rgba(28,38,32,.62);font-size:.92rem;margin-top:5px;max-width:74ch}
.head .sp{margin-left:auto}
@media(max-width:860px){
  .shell{flex-direction:column}
  .side{width:auto;height:auto;position:static;flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px}
  .side>.mark{border:0;padding:0;margin:0}
  .nav{flex-direction:row;overflow-x:auto;gap:4px;flex-wrap:nowrap}
  .nav .grp{display:none}
  .nav button{white-space:nowrap;padding:7px 11px}
  .side .me{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 0 auto;text-align:right}
  .side .me button{width:auto;margin:0}
  .main{padding:16px 14px 50px}
}

.view{display:none}.view.on{display:block}
.kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(148px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px}
.kpi{background:var(--paper2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--clay);
  border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;text-align:left;width:100%}
.kpi[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--soil);border-color:var(--soil)}
.kpi[aria-pressed="true"] .v{color:#FBF9F3}
.kpi[aria-pressed="true"] .l{color:rgba(216,198,154,.8)}
.kpi .v{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:600;font-size:1.4rem;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1}
.kpi .l{font-size:.75rem;color:rgba(28,38,32,.62);margin-top:5px}
.k-yeni{border-left-color:var(--signal)}.k-arandi{border-left-color:var(--clay)}
.k-analiz{border-left-color:#8A9A64}.k-sozlesme{border-left-color:var(--field)}
.k-uye{border-left-color:var(--soil)}.k-alert{border-left-color:var(--alert)}
.k-field{border-left-color:var(--field)}

.tools{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:13px}
.tools input,.tools select{padding:8px 10px;font-size:.89rem;min-height:38px;width:auto}
.tools .grow{flex:1;min-width:180px}
.count{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;color:rgba(28,38,32,.6)}

.card{background:var(--paper2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:16px}
.card+.card{margin-top:12px}
.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
@media(max-width:900px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.tablebox{background:var(--paper2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
.scroll{overflow-x:auto}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.87rem}
th{text-align:left;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.66rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;
  color:rgba(28,38,32,.55);font-weight:600;padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  white-space:nowrap;background:var(--paper2);cursor:pointer;user-select:none}
th .ar{opacity:.4}
td{padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line2);vertical-align:middle}
tbody tr{cursor:pointer}
tbody tr:hover{background:rgba(28,38,32,.04)}
td.r,th.r{text-align:right}
.nowrap{white-space:nowrap}
.state{padding:44px 20px;text-align:center;color:rgba(28,38,32,.6)}
.state h3{margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--ink)}

.pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.66rem;padding:3px 8px;
  border-radius:4px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;
  background:rgba(28,38,32,.08);color:rgba(28,38,32,.62)}
.p-yeni{background:rgba(214,169,40,.24);color:#7A5F10}
.p-arandi{background:rgba(166,111,79,.2);color:#7A4F38}
.p-analiz{background:rgba(138,154,100,.28);color:#3E5237}
.p-sozlesme,.p-uyumlu,.p-aktif,.p-odendi{background:rgba(96,122,85,.24);color:#3E5237}
.p-uye{background:var(--soil);color:var(--wheat)}
.p-celiski,.p-uygun-degil,.p-ayrildi,.p-iptal{background:rgba(142,74,50,.16);color:var(--alert)}
.p-bekliyor,.p-planlandi,.p-askida,.p-onayda{background:rgba(214,169,40,.24);color:#7A5F10}

.funnel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}
.fu{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.fu .lab{width:96px;flex:none;font-size:.86rem}
.fu .bar{height:24px;border-radius:4px;min-width:3px;background:var(--field)}
.fu .b1{background:var(--signal)}.fu .b2{background:var(--clay)}.fu .b3{background:#8A9A64}
.fu .b4{background:var(--field)}.fu .b5{background:var(--soil)}
.fu .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem}

.drawer{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;display:none}
.drawer.on{display:block}
.drawer .veil{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(27,36,30,.45)}
.drawer .panel{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:min(540px,100%);background:var(--paper);
  overflow-y:auto;padding:20px 22px 30px;box-shadow:-6px 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
.dh{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin-bottom:6px}
.dh h2{flex:1}
.dh button{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(28,38,32,.07);flex:none}
.dsub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.75rem;color:rgba(28,38,32,.55);margin-bottom:16px}
.kv{background:var(--paper2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 14px;margin-bottom:14px}
.kv .r{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line2);font-size:.89rem}
.kv .r:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.kv .r .k{width:130px;flex:none;color:rgba(28,38,32,.6);font-size:.84rem}
.kv .r .v{flex:1;min-width:0;word-break:break-word}
.acts{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}
.sec{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.66rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;
  color:var(--clay);font-weight:600;margin:20px 0 8px}
.log .e{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line2);font-size:.85rem}
.log .t{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.73rem;color:rgba(28,38,32,.5);width:88px;flex:none}

.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:22px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(140%);
  background:var(--soil);color:var(--paper);padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;font-size:.9rem;
  z-index:99;transition:.24s;max-width:92vw}
.toast.on{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}
.toast.bad{background:var(--alert)}
.progress{height:8px;background:rgba(28,38,32,.08);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:7px}.progress i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--field)}.flow{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.flow span{padding:7px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:var(--paper2);font-size:.78rem}.flow b{color:var(--clay)}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="login-wrap" id="loginWrap">
  <div class="login">
    <div class="lh">
      <div class="mark"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background:#D8C69A"></i><i style="background:#A66F4F"></i><i style="background:#7A4F38"></i><i style="background:#26342B"></i></span>Topracon Yönetim</div>
      <h1>Personel girişi</h1>
      <p>Bu ekran Topracon çalışanları içindir. Çiftçi başvuruları ve kişisel veriler burada görünür.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lb">
      <form id="lf" novalidate>
        <div class="field"><label class="f" for="lMail">E-posta</label><input type="email" id="lMail" autocomplete="username" placeholder="ad@topracon.com"></div>
        <div class="field"><label class="f" for="lPw">Şifre</label><input type="password" id="lPw" autocomplete="current-password"></div>
        <button class="btn block" type="submit" id="lBtn" style="margin-top:18px">Giriş yap</button>
      </form>
      <div class="msg bad" id="lMsg"></div>
      <p class="tiny" style="margin-top:16px">Hesabınız yoksa yöneticinizden isteyin. Kendi kendine kayıt kapalıdır ve hesap açmak tek başına veri erişimi vermez.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="app"><div class="shell">
  <aside class="side">
    <div class="mark"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true"><i style="background:#D8C69A"></i><i style="background:#A66F4F"></i><i style="background:#7A4F38"></i><i style="background:#26342B"></i></span>Topracon</div>
    <nav class="nav" id="nav"></nav>
    <div class="me"><b id="meName">—</b><span id="meRole">—</span><button onclick="logout()">Çıkış</button></div>
  </aside>

  <main class="main">
    <section class="view on" id="v-ozet">
      <div class="head"><div><h1>Genel bakış</h1><p id="ozetSub">Bugünün durumu ve dikkat isteyen işler.</p></div>
        <span class="sp"></span><button class="btn ghost sm" onclick="loadAll()">Yenile</button></div>
      <div class="kpis" id="ozetKpi"></div>
      <div class="grid2">
        <div class="card"><h3 style="margin-bottom:12px">Başvuru hattı</h3><div class="funnel" id="huni"></div></div>
        <div class="card"><h3 style="margin-bottom:12px">Dikkat isteyenler</h3><div id="isler"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px"><h3 style="margin-bottom:10px">İl dağılımı</h3>
        <div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>İl</th><th class="r">Başvuru</th><th class="r">Üye</th><th class="r">Dönüm</th></tr></thead><tbody id="ilTablo"></tbody></table></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="view" id="v-basvuru">
      <div class="head"><div><h1>Başvurular</h1><p>Çiftçi sayfasındaki formdan gelen adaylar. Görüşme yapıldıkça durumu ilerletin; sözleşme imzalanınca "Üyeye çevir" deyin.</p></div>
        <span class="sp"></span><button class="btn ghost sm" onclick="csvBasvuru()">CSV indir</button></div>
      <div class="kpis" id="bKpi"></div>
      <div class="tools">
        <input class="grow" type="search" id="bQ" placeholder="Ad, telefon, köy veya kooperatif ara…" oninput="drawBasvuru()">
        <select id="bIl" onchange="drawBasvuru()"><option value="">Tüm iller</option></select>
        <select id="bOnc" onchange="drawBasvuru()"><option value="">Tüm öncelikler</option><option value="yuksek">Yüksek</option><option value="normal">Normal</option><option value="dusuk">Düşük</option></select>
        <span class="count" id="bCnt"></span></div>
      <div class="tablebox"><div class="scroll"><table id="bTbl"><thead><tr id="bHead"></tr></thead><tbody id="bBody"></tbody></table></div>
        <div class="state" id="bState" style="display:none"></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="view" id="v-ciftci">
      <div class="head"><div><h1>Üye çiftçiler</h1><p>Sözleşmesi imzalanmış üreticiler. Parselleri, defter kayıtları ve ödemeleri buradan izlenir.</p></div>
        <span class="sp"></span><button class="btn sm" onclick="yeniCiftci()">Elle üye ekle</button></div>
      <div class="kpis" id="cKpi"></div>
      <div class="tools"><input class="grow" type="search" id="cQ" placeholder="Ad, telefon, sözleşme no ara…" oninput="drawCiftci()">
        <select id="cDurum" onchange="drawCiftci()"><option value="">Tüm durumlar</option><option value="aktif">Aktif</option><option value="askida">Askıda</option><option value="ayrildi">Ayrıldı</option></select>
        <span class="count" id="cCnt"></span></div>
      <div class="tablebox"><div class="scroll"><table id="cTbl"><thead><tr><th>Sözleşme</th><th>Ad soyad</th><th>Telefon</th><th>İl / ilçe</th><th class="r">Parsel</th><th class="r">Dönüm</th><th>Mühendis</th><th>Durum</th></tr></thead><tbody id="cBody"></tbody></table></div>
        <div class="state" id="cState" style="display:none"></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="view" id="v-parsel">
      <div class="head"><div><h1>Parseller</h1><p>Tarla kütüğü. Sınır ve alan yanlışsa tüm karbon hesabı yanlış olur; baz toprak analizi girilmemiş parseller kırmızı görünür.</p></div>
        <span class="sp"></span><button class="btn sm" onclick="yeniParsel()">Parsel ekle</button></div>
      <div class="kpis" id="pKpi"></div>
      <div class="tools"><input class="grow" type="search" id="pQ" placeholder="Parsel, çiftçi, köy ara…" oninput="drawParsel()">
        <select id="pDurum" onchange="drawParsel()"><option value="">Tüm durumlar</option><option value="aktif">Aktif</option><option value="beklemede">Beklemede</option><option value="cikarildi">Çıkarıldı</option></select>
        <span class="count" id="pCnt"></span></div>
      <div class="tablebox"><div class="scroll"><table id="pTbl"><thead><tr><th>Parsel</th><th>Çiftçi</th><th>Köy / ilçe</th><th class="r">Dönüm</th><th>Ürün</th><th>Taahhüt</th><th class="r">Baz SOC</th><th>Analiz</th><th>Durum</th></tr></thead><tbody id="pBody"></tbody></table></div>
        <div class="state" id="pState" style="display:none"></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="view" id="v-defter">
      <div class="head"><div><h1>Tarla defteri</h1><p>Çiftçinin telefondan girdiği kayıtlar ve kâğıt defterden işlenenler. Uydu ile çelişen kayıtlar burada çözülür; çözülmezse o parselin katkısı hesaptan düşer.</p></div>
        <span class="sp"></span><button class="btn sm" onclick="yeniAktivite()">Kâğıttan kayıt gir</button></div>
      <div class="kpis" id="aKpi"></div>
      <div class="tools"><input class="grow" type="search" id="aQ" placeholder="Parsel, çiftçi, işlem ara…" oninput="drawAktivite()">
        <select id="aDog" onchange="drawAktivite()"><option value="">Tüm doğrulamalar</option><option value="bekliyor">Bekliyor</option><option value="uyumlu">Uyumlu</option><option value="celiski">Çelişki</option><option value="muaf">Muaf</option></select>
        <select id="aTip" onchange="drawAktivite()"><option value="">Tüm işlemler</option></select>
        <span class="count" id="aCnt"></span></div>
      <div class="tablebox"><div class="scroll"><table id="aTbl"><thead><tr><th>Tarih</th><th>Parsel</th><th>Çiftçi</th><th>İşlem</th><th>Detay</th><th class="r">Alan</th><th>Kaynak</th><th>Doğrulama</th></tr></thead><tbody id="aBody"></tbody></table></div>
        <div class="state" id="aState" style="display:none"></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="view" id="v-odeme">
      <div class="head"><div><h1>Ödemeler</h1><p>Avans, bakiye ve mahsuplar. Avans ekimden önce ödenir — geciken avans çiftçinin geçişi ertelemesi demektir.</p></div>
        <span class="sp"></span><button class="btn ghost sm" onclick="csvOdeme()">CSV indir</button>
        <button class="btn sm" onclick="yeniOdeme()">Ödeme planla</button></div>
      <div class="kpis" id="oKpi"></div>
      <div class="tools"><input class="grow" type="search" id="oQ" placeholder="Çiftçi, açıklama, dekont ara…" oninput="drawOdeme()">
        <select id="oDurum" onchange="drawOdeme()"><option value="">Tüm durumlar</option><option value="planlandi">Planlandı</option><option value="onayda">Onayda</option><option value="odendi">Ödendi</option><option value="iptal">İptal</option></select>
